<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh inflation slows to 2.4 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Kazakh inflation slows to 2.4 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's monthly inflation rate slowed to 2.4 percent in November from 2.9 percent in October, the National Bank of Kazakhstan said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH CONSUMER PRICES	NOV 96  OCT 96   NOV 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change     +2.4    +2.9     +4.4</p>
<p>The year-on-year percentage change was unavailable. The National Bank estimates annual inflation for 1996 at 27.5 percent.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
